{"type": "answer", "text": "The Moss docs do not say whether Moss is GDPR compliant, and they do not name an EU region or any hosting region. The only residency mention is \"Data residency / VPC deploy\", which the pricing page lists as Enterprise-only (not on Developer, Hobbyist or Startup). The same page lists SOC 2 and HIPAA as Enterprise-only too. Telemetry is sent to https://service.usemoss.dev/index/telemetry, and cloud indexes and synced documents are sent to the Moss service, but the docs give no region for that service. Queries never leave the device, per the Telemetry page. For GDPR or EU hosting, ask Moss directly or check the Privacy Policy (docs.moss.dev/docs/privacy), which I could not retrieve through the search tool."}
